["Lady Liadrin, secure the pass. For good or ill, we've taken a stand here. We should keep it."] = true,
["Champion, you've uncovered many threats that besiege Quel'Thalas. We must plan our next move together."] = true,
["Seek out Umbric in Tranquillien. Reach out when you have more to share."] = true,
["We can't defend against both the Voidstorm and the aggression from the Lightbloom."] = true,
["Turalyon, how does our army fare?"] = true,
["If Fairbreeze is safe--the Voidstorm still looms."] = true,
["The Sunwell can only be empowered for so long. Those who are maintaining its current state are under immense strain."] = true,
["The Sunwell holds for now, only through the constant effort of its defenders. Should their strength waver..."] = true,
["The rest of us will return to Silvermoon. There is... much to discuss."] = true,
["Halduron has joined your haranir friend to aid in ending the threat. They await you in Fairbreeze."] = true,
