},
[137255] = {
["Name"] = {
["enUS"] = "Derelict Hexapod",
},
},
[237601] = {
["BroadcastText"] = {
["enUS"] = {
["For my first lesson, learn from the revered heroes of the past and what inspired their Light."] = true,
["The most revered paladins didn't draw their faith in the Light from warfare. They fought to preserve what they valued most."] = true,
["Such a troubled boy. That'll happen when your father leaves a gaping wound in your chest. Not to worry--I have a plan."] = true,
["$PLAYER_NAME$! We're going to save the Sunwell. More importantly, we're going to fix that broken young man."] = true,
["The Light needs a lens to focus its power through the wielder. The Light brings certainty, and it responds to one's conviction."] = true,
["The Light seeks a path. It does not dictate the way."] = true,
["However... the relics they possess will do for our purposes of bolstering the Sunwell defenders."] = true,
["They claimed many relics when they seized my church. Relics that would be better used to our purpose of holding back Xal'atath."] = true,
["It... will be good to reclaim them."] = true,
["The Scarlet Crusade was founded by a paladin I personally anointed. For a long time, I saw them as my own misjudgment made manifest. Perhaps I still do."] = true,
["But the Light cannot distinguish between love and hatred."] = true,
["Look at all the cultures across Azeroth that channel the Light. From Elune, to Gral, to An'she."] = true,
["Philosophically different from our Church of Holy Light, but with the same ability to channel the energy."] = true,
["And why they were able to pervert my teachings of fellowship and protection into something you and I recognize so clearly as evil."] = true,
},
},
["Name"] = {
["enUS"] = "Alonsus Faol",
},
},
[128020] = {
["Name"] = {
["enUS"] = "Bloat",
},
},
