[239650] = {
["BroadcastText"] = {
["enUS"] = {
["The haranir always avoided the Rift of Aln. The dissonant echoes of the goddess's song brought madness. The violent manifestations within brought death."] = true,
["The creatures remembered where she had been."] = true,
["With the paint made within her cauldron, Sai'alyo would put her very soul into the paintings, and finding memories even beyond her own."] = true,
["She saw in this not pain, but duty. Immune to the echoes, she hunted the shadows within the rift, and trained any who made her sacrifice to do the same."] = true,
["We learned the shape of the beasts."] = true,
["Aln'hara leaves no trace by accident. The Bloom was not a gift... it was a promise. Living, sacred, and real. Thank you for revealing the truth of its story."] = true,
["As the memories of the haranir faded, she sought ways to bind them to the world. Colors alone could not carry history--she needed more."] = true,
["The Cauldron of Echoes first belonged to Zur'ashar Sai'alyo. She was no simple artist. She was the bridge to the forgotten."] = true,
["The seekers sat in silence. Even there, we heard her song."] = true,
["The stones echoed her song, but this one was different. Within it the song stirred, yearning to share its tune."] = true,
["This was no ordinary pigment. The Alndust within began to rage! Chaos spilled forth--the Cauldron of Echoes convulsing as untamed colors took flight."] = true,
["The seekers did not cry out for the goddess's return. They listened, and waited, in the quiet places where memory clings."] = true,
["They followed not a path, but an echo of feeling."] = true,
["To stand in the stillness where her presence once stirred... that is no small honor. Go now, and listen with more than ears."] = true,
["Sai'alyo searched for answers in what the pigments left behind, trying to weave a revelation yet unseen."] = true,
["Morta'ka was contained, but the creature continues to plague the Rift of Aln even to this day."] = true,
["Fungarian tenacity meets rutaani thorns, and all of Harandar bleeds. We haranir step in, not to win a war, but to prune it before the rot consumes all."] = true,
["This one will leave an impression at their initiation."] = true,
["She was not in the light--she was the warmth it left behind."] = true,
["In times of quiet, we felt empty. We longed for purpose."] = true,
["Grown to a size that none could ignore, the fungarian used their might to put an end to the battle. Their actions were to separate the combatants, not break them."] = true,
["A rare honor is yours, $PLAYER_NAME$: to discover the secret behind this fungarian spear. I look forward to what you uncover."] = true,
["Obayo found the flames were not all that was sacrificed. She no longer heard the goddess. The connection had been burned out of her."] = true,
["Instead, the flame was split into three wards that would contain the beast and save all of Harandar."] = true,
["She did not return. But something of her remained, blooming in the silence for those who remembered."] = true,
["I envy your opportunity to see Obayo and learn about the Echoless Flame, $PLAYER_NAME$."] = true,
["We grew to become the forest's greatest hunters."] = true,
["Through Alndust's shimmer, Sai'alyo unlocked the secrets of the living paintings. With power entwined with peril, she entrusted that legacy to the Zur'ashar."] = true,
["The first skirmish is halted, yet anger still simmers. The leaders of both sides refuse to reason except for one."] = true,
["What you uncovered... is astounding! Our sacred paints were not simply mixed--they were awakened. And in the Cauldron of Echoes, they had their first breath."] = true,
["Obayo knew the Echoless Flame was their best hope."] = true,
["Behold Russula, an advocate for mercy whose plea was drowned by the drums of war. But Russula knew how to make their voice heard over the din."] = true,
["Some creatures became consumed with gluttony, in order to fill the void created from her departure."] = true,
["With the fighting ended, they lay down their spear and asked the haranir to stop the killing. This is Russula's lesson: strength can bring victory, but tempered with mercy, it brings a greater victory."] = true,
["Some creatures still sang in harmony with her."] = true,
["The manifestations were wracked by the discordant song of the rift, but the Echoless Flame brought them peace."] = true,
["But a creature called Morta'ka led the manifestations from the rift, threatening all of Harandar."] = true,
["Rivaling, and then taming the fiercest predators."] = true,
["We called out with song. She did not answer. But something she left behind did. And it was enough."] = true,
["Some creatures forgot her song and listened only to the silence that followed."] = true,
["Obayo knew that the power remaining within the Echoless Flame was not enough to destroy Morta'ka."] = true,
["May Russula's Outreach remind us to temper our claws. Harandar endures longest when mercy guides the hunt."] = true,
["The echoes do not lie. They repeat what was, for those brave enough to hear. Go, and return with the voice of the past."] = true,
["Unfortunate that we do not possess the knowledge to reignite the Echoless Flame. Perhaps one day..."] = true,
["In the presence of the Echoless Flame, none could hear the goddess's song."] = true,
},
},
["Name"] = {
["enUS"] = "Zur'ashar Kassameh",
},
},
