[129210] = {
["BroadcastText"] = {
["enUS"] = {
["Yes, Cenarius! We are here to save you!"] = true,
["My bond with the Emerald Dream gives me great power... but it also makes me vulnerable to the rift's darkness. I have peered inside it and know this to be true. Should I step within, I would be lost... just as Cenarius was."] = true,
["I must see with my own eyes what horrors have befallen my beloved teacher. Steel your hearts against the darkness, heroes."] = true,
["This was the Emerald Dreamway. During my long slumber, it was here I communed with the Green Dragonflight."] = true,
["Oh Ysondre! How cruel fate can be! Cleansed of the Nightmare once before, only to become its victim yet again. Some wounds never truly heal."] = true,
["Now this sacred place has been made into a conduit for the Nightmare to spread its corruption. This we cannot allow!"] = true,
["Cenarius! Do not listen to him!"] = true,
["The Twilight's Hammer ambushed and murdered Elerethe, misleading her into believing Hamuul Runetotem played a part in her death. It seems her spirit was so twisted that she sought to take vengeance upon all of Thunder Bluff."] = true,
["If this seed takes hold, the roots of its infestation will wind their way into the heart of Azeroth. The Nightmare would devour our world, claiming everything... everyone. This must not come to pass!"] = true,
["What horror is this? A tumor of Nightmare infecting a world tree, here in the reflection of the titans' own playground?"] = true,
["Hold your weapons! He begins to see the truth!"] = true,
["Moonglade is the most sacred place in all the Dream. To think that my shan'do could play any part in its corruption..."] = true,
["Xavius waits ahead in the Rift of Aln, the true heart of the Nightmare. Would that I could fight at your side, heroes, but... to this place, I cannot go."] = true,
["May you find peace at last, old friend."] = true,
["Truly there was never a soul more noble than Ursoc's. I pray his spirit finds its way back to the Dream."] = true,
["They will be more than prepared, for your true power rests in the Nightmare."] = true,
["If you need further proof of how insidious the Nightmare is, look there! Even the fierce heart of Ursoc has succumbed. Release him, I beg you!"] = true,
["Let the Nightmare be cleansed!"] = true,
["Behold, the Iris opens! The way to Cenarius is clear."] = true,
["Alas, poor Nythendra! She served faithfully as Guardian of the Dream, only to be perverted into a gatekeeper of corruption."] = true,
["What manner of foul creature is this? It seems poised to unleash its corruption upon Thunder Bluff! The spirit of the tauren people must not fall prey to the Nightmare!"] = true,
["Pray that purging the Nightmare's corruption buys us enough time to defeat the Legion and catch our breath before the black armies rise up from the depths."] = true,
["Can it be? My old master is blind to the lies of Xavius and thinks WE are the source of the infestation!"] = true,
["Go. Destroy the Nightmare Lord. Only this way can the Dream be restored... and Azeroth be saved."] = true,
["A well-earned victory! We must, however, stay vigilant. Deep inside the Nightmare Xavius remains, unvanquished. The enemy you fought here was merely his shadow."] = true,
["An empty threat. You hold no sway over this realm, Nightmare Lord."] = true,
["Cenarius! It breaks my heart to see my shan'do twisted and torn this way. If we can subdue him, I will do everything in my power to purge the vile touch of Xavius from his spirit."] = true,
["From each of these pathways, a palpable evil emanates. Choose a course, and know that I will stand with you."] = true,
["No doubt Xavius and his ancient master delight that so much of our attention goes into fighting the Legion. Their insidious shadow seeps into our world, distracting us with whispers and doubts."] = true,
["I sense the touch of Cenarius upon this Iris. It is a portal that leads to Moonglade, but the way has been sealed by dark magic. We must sever the tendrils of power that bind it."] = true,
["I will not lose you, shan'do!"] = true,
["It is done! Cenarius is beaten, but my great teacher lives. Now I must focus all of my strength to cleanse him."] = true,
["I have faced the Nightmare before, but never has it had so thorough a stranglehold on the Dream. It hungers, desperate to seed its corruption. Do not let its whispers seduce you into madness!"] = true,
["You have been deceived, my teacher! Xavius has twisted your perceptions! I beg of you, let me cleanse you of his evil!"] = true,
["The illusion of corruption falls away! Behold a druid who was as a sister to me... Elerethe Renferal. I feel her loss keenly, heroes."] = true,
["So says the shadow of Xavius."] = true,
["We must put an end to the Nightmare. Say the word and I will take us into the heart of that twisted place."] = true,
},
},
["Name"] = {
["enUS"] = "Malfurion Stormrage",
},
},
