["That will unbalance the magical focus, though, and cause a reverse vibration in the ether."] = true,
["But what if the resulting frequency shift were to send magical feedback up the flows?"] = true,
["The portal will shift slightly, at this point if you cast a binding cantrip you will solidify it in place."] = true,
["Only if we didn't follow the proper initialization procedures."] = true,
["I suppose that could work, if we had twenty people to cast it with."] = true,
["If we use the appropriate sequence we should be ok. Will just take some serious studying before we start."] = true,
["Always so negative. The chances of that happening are between zero and none."] = true,
["Why can't we just shift the array to compensate for the variance in the flux?"] = true,
