["I can sense one of the Legion's masters working to reanimate the Avatar of Sargeras. Should Kil'jaeden infuse that husk with the Dark Titan's power, I do not know whether any force on this world can stop it."] = true,
["From this stone flowed rivers and seas, the very lifeblood of Azeroth. Today it washes clean the darkness that scars our world."] = true,
["My protective wards now bar your way. Each seal can only be opened with one of the Pillars of Creation. Be warned: the demons will stop at nothing to prevent your advance."] = true,
["These tears of perfect beauty embody the dream of what our world could be. Today they purify your hearts for the battle to come."] = true,
["This hammer forged ancient wonders and shaped the earth itself. Today it shatters the bonds of fate that seek to crush us all."] = true,
["The Pillars of Creation are in place. Return to the Cathedral and I will reveal the ancient secret this temple holds."] = true,
