["Take her shadow for your own, Alleria! Do as I trained you!"] = true,
["It is rare that a naaru falls into Void this way. The few cases I know of have occurred when mortals were involved. What fascinating implications..."] = true,
["Yes, the naaru. We must get inside. Alleria, the skills you have learned can open the way."] = true,
