["The Void is a force of change... of transformation. Shadows are fluid, ever shifting."] = true,
["It is rare that a naaru falls into Void this way. The few cases I know of have occurred when mortals were involved. What fascinating implications..."] = true,
["Let's not get ahead of ourselves. We need to test the limits of this newfound power. Come."] = true,
